      "id": "claim_411d0668f28c4683aa0c27ab5af23204",
      "statement": "OpenWikiLocalShellBackend wraps deepagents' LocalShellBackend and layers three independent security boundaries: .openwikiignore exclusion, docs-only write confinement, and Claims-state ownership, all canonicalizing paths before matching against a possibly prompt-injected agent.",
