    {
      "id": "claim_1b50e8c42af24e269c7ad031b3ace35e",
      "statement": "In docs-only repository runs, writes and edits are refused unless the path is under openwiki/ (with the prefix check itself canonicalized so /openwiki/../AGENTS.md cannot escape); local-wiki mode relaxes this check entirely, since the local wiki is the whole write target.",
