      "id": "claim_3620166dcea24443830f93fff02ab7fd",
      "statement": "Repository .claims sidecar state is implementation-owned: it is hidden from generic file tools (read/readRaw/write/edit/delete/ls/glob/grep/upload/download) and refused to shell execute, which is directed to inspect_claims and resolve_claims instead; the ownership check applies only in repository output mode, so a local-wiki brain may keep its own .claims directory.",
