      "statement": "createAgentBackend mounts two read-only virtual filesystems over the wiki backend via a composite backend: /skills/ (bundled and user skills under ~/.openwiki/skills) and /conversation_history/ (the summarization middleware's history offload, routed under ~/.openwiki/conversation_history).",
