      "statement": "Routing the conversation-history offload to ~/.openwiki keeps it out of the documented repository and out of the docs-only guard's refusal path, which would otherwise silently degrade summarization on large repositories; the mount prefix is kept in sync with deepagents' summarization-middleware default by hand and pinned by a regression test so a dependency bump that moves the default fails loudly.",
